# Every text file is LF on every checkout, including a checkout on Windows.
#
# Git for Windows writes CRLF by default. The skill copies under .agents and
# .claude must keep the same bytes on every machine, because
# TestSkillsAreCopies compares them. The golden files in testdata are read
# byte for byte. The same rule holds in dbmeta and cql. See D3 and D71 in
# docs/decisions/.
* text=auto eol=lf
